#. type: Table
#: upstream/_generated-doc/3.2/config/quarkus-oidc-client-oidc-client-config-grant.adoc:28
#: upstream/_generated-doc/3.2/config/quarkus-oidc-client-oidc-client-config-grant.adoc:114
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "tooltip:client['client_credentials' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication only], tooltip:password['password' grant requiring both OIDC client and user ('username' and 'password') authentications], tooltip:code['authorization_code' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication as well as at least 'code' and 'redirect_uri' parameters which must be passed to OidcClient at the token request time.], tooltip:exchange['urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication as well as at least 'subject_token' parameter which must be passed to OidcClient at the token request time.], tooltip:jwt['urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:jwt-bearer' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication as well as at least an 'assertion' parameter which must be passed to OidcClient at the token request time.], tooltip:refresh['refresh_token' grant requiring an OIDC client authentication and a refresh token. Note, OidcClient supports this grant by default if an access token acquisition response contained a refresh token. However, in some cases, the refresh token is provided out of band, for example, it can be shared between several of the confidential client's services, etc. If 'quarkus.oidc-client.grant-type' is set to 'refresh' then `OidcClient` will only support refreshing the tokens.]"
msgstr "tooltip:client['client_credentials' 授权仅需 OIDC 客户端身份验证], tooltip:password['password' 授权需同时进行 OIDC 客户端和用户（'username' 和 'password'）身份验证], tooltip:code['authorization_code' 授权方式，要求进行 OIDC 客户端身份验证，并且至少包含 'code' 和 'redirect_uri' 参数，这些参数必须在令牌请求时传递给 OidcClient。], tooltip:exchange['urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange' 授权类型，需要 OIDC 客户端身份验证，同时至少需要 'subject_token' 参数，该参数必须在令牌请求时传递给 OidcClient。], tooltip:jwt['urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:jwt-bearer' 授权类型，需要 OIDC 客户端身份验证，以及至少一个 'assertion' 参数，该参数必须在令牌请求时传递给 OidcClient。], 工具提示:refresh['refresh_token' 授权需要 OIDC 客户端身份验证和一个刷新令牌。请注意，如果访问令牌获取响应中包含刷新令牌，OidcClient 默认支持此授权。 但在某些情况下，刷新令牌是通过带外方式提供的，例如，它可能在多个机密客户端服务之间共享等。如果将 'quarkus.oidc-client.grant-type' 设置为 'refresh'，则 `OidcClient` 将仅支持刷新令牌。]"

